    { question: '궁궐 관람 시 가장 중요한 용어는?', answer: '전각(왕의 국사 공간), 누각(연회·정자 건물), 단청(오방색 건물 장식)을 알면 모든 궁궐 설명이 이해됩니다.' },
    { question: '통합관람권은 어떻게 사용하나요?', answer: '₩10,000으로 5대 궁궐과 종묘를 1년간 무제한 관람할 수 있습니다. 경복궁 매표소에서 구매 가능하며, 재방문 시 요금이 절약됩니다.' },
    { question: '한복 착용 시 정말 입장료가 무료인가요?', answer: '네, 한복을 착용하면 5대 궁궐 모두 입장료가 무료입니다. 근처 한복 대여점에서 ₩15,000~₩25,000으로 대여 가능합니다.' },
    { question: '야간개장은 어떻게 이용하나요?', answer: '봄(4~5월)과 가을(9~10월)에 특별 개장합니다. 국가유산청 홈페이지에서 사전 예약 필수이며, 오픈 몇 시간 만에 매진됩니다.' },
    { question: '궁궐마다 어떤 건물이 가장 유명한가요?', answer: '경복궁: 근정전·경회루, 창덕궁: 인정전·후원(비원), 창경궁: 명정전, 덕수궁: 중화전, 종묘: 정전. 각 궁궐의 핵심 건물을 먼저 방문하세요.' },
  ],
  en: [
    { question: 'What are the most important palace terms?', answer: 'Knowing jeongjeon (throne hall), nugak (pavilion), and dancheong (decorative coloring) helps you understand all palace descriptions.' },
    { question: 'How do I use the integrated ticket?', answer: '₩10,000 gives unlimited access to all five grand palaces and Jongmyo for one year. Purchase at any palace ticket booth — great value for repeat visits.' },
    { question: 'Is admission really free when wearing hanbok?', answer: 'Yes! Hanbok wearers get free admission to all five palaces. Rental shops nearby charge ₩15,000–₩25,000.' },
    { question: 'How do I join the night tour?', answer: 'Special evening openings happen in spring (Apr–May) and autumn (Sep–Oct). Pre-book on heritage.go.kr — tickets sell out within hours.' },
    { question: 'Which buildings are must-sees at each palace?', answer: 'Gyeongbokgung: Geunjeongjeon & Gyeonghoeru. Changdeokgung: Injeongjeon & Secret Garden. Changgyeonggung: Myeongjeongjeon. Deoksugung: Junghwajeon. Jongmyo: Jeongjeon.' },
  ],
  ja: [
    { question: '宮殿観光で最も重要な用語は？', answer: '正殿（王の政務空間）、楼閣（宴会・亭建築）、丹青（五方色装飾）を知れば、すべての宮殿説明が理解できます。' },
    { question: '統合観覧券はどう使うの？', answer: '₩10,000で5大宮殿と宗廟を1年間無制限で観覧。各宮殿の窓口で購入可能。再訪問時に大変お得。' },
    { question: '韓服着用で入場料は本当に無料？', answer: 'はい！韓服着用で5大宮殿すべて入場料無料。近くのレンタル店で₩15,000〜₩25,000でレンタル可能。' },
    { question: '夜間営業はどうやって参加？', answer: '春（4〜5月）と秋（9〜10月）に特別開催。heritage.go.krで事前予約必須。数時間で完売。' },
    { question: '各宮殿で見るべき建物は？', answer: '景福宮: 勤政殿・慶會樓。昌徳宮: 仁政殿・後苑。昌慶宮: 明政殿。徳寿宮: 中和殿。宗廟: 正殿。' },
  ],
  zh: [
    { question: '宫殿参观最重要的术语有哪些？', answer: '了解正殿（国王政务空间）、楼阁（宴会亭阁）、丹青（五方色装饰），就能理解所有宫殿介绍。' },
    { question: '综合门票如何使用？', answer: '₩10,000可在一年内无限次参观五大宫殿和宗庙。在各宫殿售票处购买，多次访问非常划算。' },
    { question: '穿韩服真的免门票吗？', answer: '是的！穿韩服可免费进入全部五大宫殿。附近租赁店收费₩15,000~₩25,000。' },
    { question: '夜间开放如何参加？', answer: '春季（4~5月）和秋季（9~10月）特别开放。需在heritage.go.kr提前预约，几小时内售罄。' },
    { question: '各宫殿必看建筑？', answer: '景福宫：勤政殿·庆会楼。昌德宫：仁政殿·秘苑。昌庆宫：明政殿。德寿宫：中和殿。宗庙：正殿。' },
  ],
};

const faqItems = faqByLang[lang] || faqByLang.en;
---
<GuideLayout title={titles[lang]} description={descriptions[lang]} lang={htmlLang}>
  <style>@import '../../styles/global.css';</style>

  <div class="container">
    <BreadcrumbNav items={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Guide', url: '/guide' }, { name: 'Glossary' }]} lang={lang} />

    <article class="guide-content">
      <h1>{titles[lang]}</h1>
      <p class="guide-meta">Updated: June 2026 &middot; Korea Heritage Service official data</p>

      <p class="guide-intro">
        {lang === 'kr' && '한국 궁궐 관람에 필요한 핵심 용어를 25선으로 정리했습니다. 건축, 문화유산, 관람 정보를 한눈에 확인하세요.'}
        {lang === 'en' && '25 essential terms for visiting Korean palaces, covering architecture, heritage concepts, and practical visitor information.'}
        {lang === 'ja' && '韓国宮殿観光に必要な主要用語を25選でまとめました。建築、文化遺産、観光情報を一覧で確認。'}
        {lang === 'zh' && '整理了参观韩国宫殿所需的25条核心术语，涵盖建筑、文化遗产和游客信息。'}
      </p>

      <div class="glossary-grid">
        {glossaryTerms.map(term => (
          <div class="glossary-card">
            <h3 class="term-kr">{term.kr}</h3>
            <p class="term-translations">{term.en} / {term.ja} / {term.zh}</p>
            {lang === 'kr' && <p class="term-definition">{term.definition_kr}</p>}
            {lang === 'en' && <p class="term-definition">{term.definition_en}</p>}
            {lang === 'ja' && <p class="term-definition">{term.definition_ja}</p>}
            {lang === 'zh' && <p class="term-definition">{term.definition_zh}</p>}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0;text-align:center;">
        <ins class="adsbygoogle" style="display:block;text-align:center" data-ad-layout="in-article" data-ad-format="fluid" data-ad-client="ca-pub-5938862195544185" data-ad-slot="4797390169"></ins>
        <script>(adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});</script>
      </div>

      <FAQSection items={faqItems} lang={lang} />
    </article>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>

<style>
  .guide-content { padding: 80px 0 60px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .guide-content h1 { font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .guide-meta { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted, #9A8B7F); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .guide-intro { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 32px; color: var(--color-text-light, #6B5B4F); }
  .glossary-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; margin: 24px 0 40px; }
  .glossary-card { background: var(--color-card, #fff); border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #E8DDD4); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
  html.dark .glossary-card { background: var(--color-card, #1C1916); border-color: var(--color-border, #2D2720); }
  .glossary-card:hover { border-color: var(--color-primary, #C8956C); box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(200,149,108,0.12); }
  .term-kr { font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--color-text, #1A1210); }
  html.dark .term-kr { color: var(--color-text, #F5F0E8); }
  .term-translations { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--color-primary, #C8956C); margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 500; }
  .term-definition { font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-light, #6B5B4F); margin: 0; }
  html.dark .term-definition { color: var(--color-text-light, #B8A99A); }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .glossary-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
</style>
